{"data":{"attachmentkeynames":["rs"],"desc":"Sends one prompt with an optional system prompt to the configured LLM and returns the text. A thin wrapper over agent.llm.chat_llm - it builds a two-message conversation with no tools - so there is exactly one provider engine and one set of config keys. Failures are returned as a string starting 'ERROR: ' (agent.archivist.consolidate keeps its queue on that prefix). Set LLM_CAPTURE_DIR to log prompts and answers to disk; capture is off by default.","import":"use flowlang::datastore::DataStore;\nuse ndata::dataarray::DataArray;\nuse crate::agent::llm::chat_llm::chat_llm;\n","params":[{"name":"prompt","type":"String"},{"name":"system_prompt","type":"Any"}],"returntype":"String","type":"rust"},"id":"rjuoqv19e8fc5c83ft4","readers":[],"time":1787139425104,"username":"system","writers":[]}